    ["二段：15米的后撤位移"] = "Phase 2: 15-meter backward displacement",
    ["产自鲁恩王国间海郡康斯顿城的某座矿山，尽管整座城市受战争摧残严重，但也因此拥有了大量含有灵性的材料。因矿山周围常有一些诡异的传闻，工人们只敢挖掘最外层的燧石。"] = "Produced from a mine in Coniston, Midseashire, Loen Kingdom. Although the entire city was severely devastated by the war, it possesses a large amount of materials containing spirituality. Because of the strange rumors often surrounding the mine, workers only dare to dig for the flint on the outermost layer.",
    ["人力物力劳动力，路费车费误工费……嗯，还得再算算……"] = "Manpower, material resources, labor costs, travel expenses, lost wages... hmm, I have to calculate again...",
    ["今日菜单"] = "Today's Menu",
    ["从梦境中唤醒自身，并回复50%生命值。"] = "Awaken oneself from the dream and restore 50% of health.",
    ["他花了很多年，才用窥秘之眼看懂那一夜。\n星象从不说谎，它只是把已经发生的事，用光写在天上。 他仰头看见了真相，也仰头看见了自己的罪孽—— 没有他念出那句咒语，一切都不会发生。\n所以他要变强，要看得更远，更准，更深， 直到帷幕后面的东西无处遁形， 直到再也不会有他看不见的危险。\n星辰告诉他：你看见了多少，你就能改变多少。\n他把这句话记下来， 后来又在旁边加了一行： \"只差一步。只要得到那个皇冠，就够了。\""] = "It took him many years to understand that night with his Eyes of Mystery Prying. \n The stars never lie; they simply write what has already happened in the sky with light. He looked up and saw the truth, and he also looked up and saw his own sins—if he hadn't chanted that spell, none of it would have happened. \n So he must become stronger, see further, more accurately, and deeper, until the things behind the curtain have nowhere to hide, until there is no longer any danger he cannot see. \n The stars told him: You can change as much as you can see. \n He wrote this down, and later added a line next to it: \"Just one step away. As long as I get that crown, it will be enough.\"",
    ["以灰雾至高位格影响目标，影响结束后目标受到一定伤害，如果期间目标解控则会受到高额伤害。（影响同时自身获得灰雾加持效果）"] = "Influence the target with the high-level status of the gray fog. After the effect ends, the target takes damage. If the target uses Cleanse during this period, they take high damage. (You gain the gray fog Blessing effect simultaneously.)",
